    "preamble": "Somnath Gupta And Another vs State Of U.P. And Another on 16 May, 2023 Author: Rajiv Gupta Bench: Rajiv Gupta High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ?Neutral Citation No. - 2023:Ahc:105709 Court No. - 65 Case :- Application U/S 482 No. - 16002 of 2023 Applicant :- Somnath Gupta And Another Opposite Party :- State Of U.P. And Another Counsel for Applicant :- K.K.Rao,Sarvjeet Singh Chauhan Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Rajiv Gupta,J. 1. 2. This application under Section 482 Cr.P.C. has been filed with the prayer to quash the summoning order dated 24.01.2023 and entire proceedings of Case No. 09 of 2023 (State Vs. Lavlesh Gupta and 3 Others), under Sections 52(1), 59(iii), 58 of Food Safety and Standards Act, Police Station Khanna, District Mahoba, pending in the court of Additional Sessions Judge, Court No.1, Banda. 3.",
